     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Digraphs",
     "texto": [
      "**Sz**, **cz**, **rz**, **ch** and **dz** are written with two letters. **Ś** and **ć** are single letters with a soft sound."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Contrasts",
     "texto": [
      "**Sz** and **ś** do not sound the same; neither do **ż** and **ź**. **Rz** usually sounds like **ż**, although the spelling is learnt word by word."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
